The Daughters of Sora Kell are three powerful hags who rule [[Droaam]] — the monster nation west of Breland. They are Sora Kell (green hag matriarch), Sora Maenya (annis hag warrior), and Sora Teraza (dusk hag oracle). Together they are among the most politically significant figures outside the Five Nations.

!! The Three Sisters
* //Sora Kell// — ancient green hag; the political mind of Droaam, said to have been manipulating Khorvaire's rulers for centuries
* //Sora Maenya// — annis hag; the military enforcer, physically terrifying even among giants; keeps Droaam's fractious warlords in line
* //Sora Teraza// — dusk hag; the prophet, whose visions extend across timelines; her answers are cryptic but rarely wrong

!! Political Role
Droaam was unrecognized by the Treaty of Thronehold. The Daughters secured a cease-fire from Breland by demonstrating that conquering Droaam would be prohibitively costly, then pivoted to commerce — selling mercenary contracts through [[House Deneith]] and trading monster-derived alchemical reagents.

